<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 150,000 T optional wheat -official.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 150,000 T optional wheat -official.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has tendered to buy 150,000 tonnes of optional origin soft wheat, a senior Algerian official confirmed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The official, speaking by telephone from Algiers, said the wheat was for July and August shipment.</p>
<p>On Monday European grain traders reported Algeria was seeking 150,000 tonnes of bread-making wheat.</p>
</text>
